      "writtenOn": "2024-12-18T17:15:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Having a range not physically contiguous is not a problem, hence no error is returned. The reason why we interrupt the process is we do not want to create a sglist in the hypervisor to track the discontinuities. So instead we let the guest retry.",
